system where users can consume or redeem unused inference.\n\n8. @gitlawb - Brings legal workflows, contracts, and agent execution into programmable onchain systems.\n\n9. @reppo - Released Orquestra Lite, allowing users to register, top up, and begin mining emissions from datanets.\n\n10. @bankrbot - Gives Muse agents wallets for trading stock tokens, launching stock-paired tokens, and managing portfolios.\n\n11. @sibylcap - Completed its hackathon with 365 teams registered and 92 submissions focused on agent memory and persistent context.\n\n12. @BlockRunAI - Provides agents with pay-per-call access to AI models and RPC infrastructure through USDC.\n\n13. @ClawBankHQ - Exposes 307 tools across 18 capability groups for agents handling companies, banking, contracts, markets, and commerce.\n\n14. @openservai - SERV Reasoning API is live, with Coinbase AgentKit support for building enterprise-grade agents across DeFi, trading, payments, and commerce.","source":"Twitter for iPhone","retweetCount":18,"replyCount":27,"likeCount":111,"quoteCount":2,"viewCount":5081,"createdAt":"Thu Sep 17 21:30:01 +0000 2026","lang":"en","bookmarkCount":9,"isReply":false,"inReplyToId":null,"conversationId":"2100698814684492206","displayTextRange":[0,274],"inReplyToUserId":null,"inReplyToUsername":null,"author":{"type":"user","userName":"BaseHubHB","url":"https://x.com/BaseHubHB","twitterUrl":"https://twitter.com/BaseHubHB","id":"1685997752969564160","name":"Base Hub 🛡️","isVerified":false,"isBlueVerified":true,"verifiedType":null,"profilePicture":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1709447445523181568/NubPOLH5_normal.jpg","coverPicture":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1685997752969564160/1712072604","description":"","location":"No affiliation with Base","followers":57963,"following":28,"status":"","canDm":true,"canMediaTag":true,"createdAt":"Mon Jul 31 12:56:30 +0000 2023","entities":{"description":{"urls":[]},"url":{}},"fastFollowersCount":0,"favouritesCount":45451,"hasCustomTim